{"id":"sh/9gf6t0vu","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":164,"width":553,"height":37},"text":"Context changes the interpretation","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/of6p0ve9","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":209,"width":553,"height":119},"text":"Epsilon’s shared exposure time rules out change over time. WISE’s detector coordinates explain an apparent jump. The learner records which facts support their conclusion.","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/nexorqdo","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":355,"width":553,"height":37},"text":"The exact observations remain attached","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/mdo7ylw3","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":400,"width":553,"height":145},"text":"The record keeps the learner’s words with frame IDs, dates, wavelengths, quality results and display context. Archive links and file fingerprints connect the explanation to its source observations.","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/1cf6pgvi","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":563,"width":553,"height":77},"text":"A teacher can inspect the conclusion, the selected observations and the checks that shaped the learner’s interpretation.","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#AFB6BA","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
